WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.745
The playroom was filled with toys.

2
00:00:04.746 --> 00:00:08.691
Rabbit saw a soldier and dinosaurs.

3
00:00:08.692 --> 00:00:13.557
There were action figures and stuffed animals.

4
00:00:13.558 --> 00:00:17.597
"Hello," Rabbit said nervously.

5
00:00:17.598 --> 00:00:22.090
A triceratops waved. "Hello."

6
00:00:22.091 --> 00:00:27.049
A red remote control car spun her wheels.

7
00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:33.253
"Vroom!" she said in a friendly voice.

8
00:00:33.254 --> 00:00:35.995
But a robot glared at Rabbit.

9
00:00:35.996 --> 00:00:40.938
He was tall and shiny with angry metal eyebrows.

10
00:00:40.939 --> 00:00:43.257
"A newbie!" he snapped.

11
00:00:43.258 --> 00:00:45.935
"I don't like newbies!"

12
00:00:45.936 --> 00:00:50.102
Rabbit gulped and tried to smile.

13
00:00:50.103 --> 00:00:54.066
"Um, well, I'm happy to meet all of you.

14
00:00:54.067 --> 00:00:57.467
And I really like playing with Henry!"

15
00:00:57.468 --> 00:00:59.869
Robot's lights flashed.

16
00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:02.951
"You won't last long around here, Rabbit.

17
00:01:02.952 --> 00:01:06.482
You're not made of strong stuff like me."

18
00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:13.069
He laughed. "You don't even have legs!"

19
00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:14.900
Rabbit's ears drooped.

20
00:01:14.901 --> 00:01:18.103
Robot was right.

21
00:01:18.104 --> 00:01:21.525
Rabbit's body was just a cloth sack.

22
00:01:21.526 --> 00:01:26.571
He had no legs and no feet.

23
00:01:26.572 --> 00:01:29.630
"Be nice, Robot," someone said.

24
00:01:29.631 --> 00:01:31.772
It was a horse.

25
00:01:31.773 --> 00:01:35.593
Horse's stuffing was lumpy.

26
00:01:35.594 --> 00:01:39.154
His coat was shabby and worn.

27
00:01:39.155 --> 00:01:43.355
"You're welcome here, Rabbit," Horse said.

28
00:01:43.356 --> 00:01:47.455
"I'm sure you'll make Henry happy."

29
00:01:47.456 --> 00:01:49.998
"Thank you," Rabbit said.

30
00:01:49.999 --> 00:01:53.397
Horse's kind voice made Rabbit feel better.

31
00:01:53.398 --> 00:01:55.341
Horse smiled.

32
00:01:55.342 --> 00:02:01.185
"Soft toys like us last the longest," he whispered.

33
00:02:01.186 --> 00:02:03.316
Robot snapped his claw.

34
00:02:03.317 --> 00:02:05.499
"Ha!" he said.

35
00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:10.750
"We'll see about that!"

